As per final order for the  following ;
 REASONS 10. Point No.1 :- The allegation of the prosecution against the accused is that the accused no.2 with an intention to illegally earn money, started M/s.Graniti Properties Pvt., Ltd., at No.3, 3rd cross,
10th A Main, 2nd stage, Indiranagar and purchased agricultural land in Sy.No.183, 184, 185 from CW2 to 7 and executed GPA/Agreement with them.

In this regard, the accused persons collected Rs.2,00,000/-
from CW 1 and entered into sale agreement with regard to site No.203 situated at Erandahalli,
Hoskote taluk, thereafter neither allotted the site nor returned the money paid by the CW 1, thereby cheated the CW 1.
